  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e3cf711bd06ef4f479a2906fc1414ca9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Vieja7_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptableObjects.Dialogues.DialoguesData
  language: 1
  dialogues:
  - <jump>Aw <color=#FF00FF>Sonny</color>!</jump> Your knees look worse than mine!
  - You fell? I can't blame you. This is the area where the warriors trained their
    physical fitness. Only a few finished the test.
  - It was so funny, watching them try again and again... Silently and from far away,
    of course. The training must never be interrupted.
  - It was prohibited to come close, I was terrified of doing so. But <color=yellow>I
    remember coming with someone</color=yellow>, she always convinced me. We used
    to return hours later, crying from laughter.
  - <wave amplitude=2>It was so long ago that sometimes I forgot I was that person...</wave>
